@startuml environment_lantern_additions

' EnvironmentManager に追加したランタン関連の差分図

package environment {
  class EnvironmentManager {
    -- Fields --
    - gameWindow: GameWindow
    - timeCycle: WorldTimeCycle
    - lighting: Lighting
    - lightCircleSize: int

    -- Methods --
    + EnvironmentManager(gameWindow: GameWindow)
    + setUp(): void
    + update(delta: double): void
    + draw(g2: Graphics2D): void
  }

  class WorldTimeCycle {
    -- Fields --
    - timeSeconds: double
    - periodSeconds: double

    -- Methods --
    + WorldTimeCycle(periodSeconds: double)
    + update(delta: double): void
    + getBrightness(): float
  }

  class Lighting {
    -- Fields --
    - darknessFilter: BufferedImage
    - lastCenterX: int
    - lastCenterY: int
    - lastCircleSize: int
    - lastBrightness: float

    -- Methods --
    + Lighting(gameWindow: GameWindow, circleSize: int)
    + updateAndMaybeRecreate(circleSize: int, brightness: float): void
    + updateAndMaybeRecreate(circleSize: int, brightness: float, hasLantern: boolean, lanternRadius: int, lanternIntensity: float): void
    + draw(g2: Graphics2D): void
  }
}

package window {
  class GameWindow {
    + getPlayer(): Player
    + getObj(): Entity[]
    + repaint(): void
  }
}

package player {
  class Player {
    + getCurrentLight(): Entity
    + getWorldX(): int
    + getWorldY(): int
  }
}

package entity {
  class Entity {
    + isLightSource(): boolean
    + getLightRadius(): int
    + getLightIntensity(): float
  }
}

environment.EnvironmentManager --> window.GameWindow : uses
environment.EnvironmentManager --> environment.WorldTimeCycle : owns/updates
environment.EnvironmentManager --> environment.Lighting : owns/updates
environment.EnvironmentManager ..> player.Player : reads currentLight
player.Player --> entity.Entity : currentLight (nullable)
environment.Lighting ..> window.GameWindow : reads player position for filter center

note right of environment.EnvironmentManager
**Notes**
- update(delta) で WorldTimeCycle を更新し brightness を取得する。
- Player の currentLight を参照して hasLantern, lanternRadius, lanternIntensity を算出する。
- Lighting.updateAndMaybeRecreate(...) に昼夜明るさとランタンパラメータを渡してフィルタ再生成を判定する。

- Update(delta) updates the WorldTimeCycle and obtains the current brightness.
- It reads the Player's currentLight to determine hasLantern, lanternRadius, and lanternIntensity.
- It passes day/night brightness and lantern parameters to Lighting.updateAndMaybeRecreate(...) to decide whether to recreate the filter.
end note

note right of environment.Lighting
**Notes**
- 全画面暗転フィルタを生成・キャッシュする責務。
- ランタン装備時は追加パラメータ（radius, intensity）を受け取り、光の描画を調整する。
- 再生成は画面サイズ・中心位置・明るさ・ランタン状態の変化で行う。

- Responsible for generating and caching the full-screen darkness filter.
- When a lantern is equipped, it accepts additional parameters (radius, intensity) and adjusts the light rendering accordingly.
- Re-creation occurs when screen size, center position, brightness, or lantern state changes.
end note

@enduml